{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:11 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"現場為大埔社山村。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a5dee87400c0c30d3ec734195b1ee57/2026-10/004_16.png\"/><p>今日（19日）下午3時39分，警方接獲大埔社山村一間村屋的78歲姓陳男住客報案，指其飼養的貓疑被64歲鄰居的8隻唐狗咬傷。警員到場調查，發現涉事貓隻已明顯死亡，但未知是哪一隻狗襲擊貓隻。鄰居向事主表示願意作出賠償，警方經調查後案件暫時沒有可疑，將會轉交漁護署作進一步跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:19:35.024551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:11:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:58:00.530911+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:17:43.136252+00:00","content_hash":"e5e35c7e67c1e1ed83cbf54363e395fef9f68f9cd05d2c8b4b8cb492f6f515bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}